@startuml TripOS_System_Context
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #1a3a3a
skinparam packageBorderColor #1a3a3a

title TripOS — System Context

actor "Travel Agent" as Agent
actor "Platform Admin" as Admin
actor "Customer" as Customer
actor "Partner App" as Partner

rectangle "TripOS" {
  component "Web\n(Next.js)" as Web
  component "API\n(FastAPI)" as API
  component "Worker\n(outbox)" as Worker
  database "PostgreSQL" as DB
  database "Redis" as Redis
}

cloud "External" {
  component "TBO\n(sandbox/live)" as TBO
  component "Razorpay\n(or mock)" as Pay
  component "Email\n(Resend)" as Email
}

Agent --> Web : browse / quote / CRM
Admin --> Web : L2B / orgs / ops
Customer --> Web : public quote /q/{token}
Partner --> API : X-API-Key\n/api/v1/partner/*

Web --> API : /api/v1/*
API --> DB
API --> Redis : shopping cache / meters
API --> TBO : adapter (when live)
API --> Pay : pay links / webhooks
API --> Email : verify / reset
Worker --> DB : drain outbox
Worker --> TBO : book / cancel

@enduml
